{
  "id": "2SA.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Sang'Weli 1",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kwigwa ng'hūlū ja lūfu lo ng'wa Saulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo aho alīcha, ū Daūdi akasangwa alī na shikū ibīlī wizile ī Zikilagi, kūfuma ūko akajūūlwa na Baamaleki ūbapyeena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha lūshikū lwa kadatū lwaho wiza munhū kūfuma ū kū ng'hambī ya ng'wa Saulo; ī shizwalo shakwe shitandagūkile, nū kū ntwe okalaga lūbuubu. Aho washika a halī Daūdi ūgwa ū kū būtongi wakwe ūntugīja mazwi ng'wikūjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūmūūja, “Wafuma halī?” Nang'hwe ūshosha, “Napūlūgūka kūfuma kū ng'hambī ya Baisilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūbūūja hangī, “Aliniwīlage yaja ko kinehe?” Sūmba ūhaya, “A banhū babūpeela ū būlūgū, babūlagwa bingī no; nīyo nū Saulo wachaaga, nū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Yonasani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi ūmūja ū nsūmba ūyo akang'wīla ī mihayo yenīyo, “Bebe wadeeba kinehe ī gīkī ū Saulo nū Yonasani bachaaga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nsūmba ng'wenūyo ūhaya, “Naalī nasangwa nalī kū lūgūlū lwa Giliboa, hūna numona ū Saulo wichimaga ichimu lyakwe lyūpulung'hanya; a bashilikale ba magogoteni nabo nūbabona bang'wegeelaga gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu kwilalangīja kwakwe ūnibona ūnitana; nane niidīka, ‘Nene ūūyū baba.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūnibūūja, ‘Ūlī nani ū bebe?’ Nūng'wīla, ‘Nalī ūmò wa Baamaleki.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūniwīla, ‘Egeelaga aha ūnimalīje nache, nguno nalumīlaga kībi no, hama nalīsaatwa kīngī nasho, alīyo hangī nataalī nalīmpanga!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana nūng'wegeela nūmūlaga, nguno naalī nabona gīkī ūmo wagwīlaga ng'wenūmo atūdūla ū kūpīla; hūna nīsola ī ngikili īyo yalī ū kū ntwe gwakwe, nī ndeji",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ndeji:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū ngufu gwa nyatemi gwa kūzwaalwa mu nkono, gwa koolecha gīkī ū ng'wenūyū ntemi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " īyo yalī ū mu nkono gwakwe, shiish'aha nakwenhela baba būgonzo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi na a banhū bakwe būshidima ī shizwalo shabo būshitandūla kūlwa būpīna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kūlwa būpīna:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyū gūtīmo ū mu shandīkwa, gongejiagwa kūlwa koolecha ī nguno īyo īkabenheleja kūtandūla shizwalo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlīla ng'hūngū bakūnīlaga ū Saulo nū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Yonasani, nī libità lya ng'wa SEEBA, pyī nī numba ya Isilaeli, nguno ya kūgwishiwa na līlūshū; ū lūshikū lwenūlo būfunga kūshisha mhīndī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūnshokeela kūmūja hangī ū nsūmba ūyo akang'wenhela ī mhola jenījo; ūng'wīla, “Bebe ūlī muna halī?” Ūhaya, “Nalī ng'witūnja wa nobeji, muna Amaleki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūmūja, “Ni kinehe walī waleka kogoha kūbūūcha nkono gwako kūnyagaja ū ng'witīīlwa magūta o ng'wa SEEBA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Daūdi witana ūmò wa banhū bakwe ūng'wīla, “Nsangage hoi ūkamūlage!” Ng'hana ūntūla ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūmūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi numho wamalaga kūng'wīla, “A mininga gako gidīkīle ha ntwe gwako bebe ng'wenekīlī. Nguno wikaanīla bebe ng'wenekīlī na nomo gwako ūlīyomba gīkī, ‘Namūlagaga ū ng'witīīlwa maguta o ng'wa SEEBA.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūnīla Saulo na Yonasani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Daūdi ūlīla ng'hūngū akūnīlaga ū Saulo nū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Yonasani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūlagīla gīkī a banhū ba Yuda balangwe ī mihayo ya ng'hūngū yenīyī, (yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'wa Yashaali). Ūhaya: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ee Isilaeli, abo baalī shingilima yako balambalalaga kū magūlya ga sī yako, būchīla kwenūko!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
